BrainChip's own assets
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The following are BrainChip work, included under this repository's licence.

  Logos and artwork
    .github/assets/brainchip-logo.svg, .github/assets/brainchip-logo-dark.svg
      The BrainChip logo, in the light and dark variants the README
      switches between.
    src/app/assets/images/00_Start/BrainChipLogo.svg, BrainChipLogo.png
    src/app/assets/images/00_Start/NeuronLogo.svg, NeuronLogo.png
    src/app/assets/images/00_Start/Logo.png
    src/app/assets/images/00_Start/AIAppControl.svg, BLE.svg, OTA.svg,
      SensorData.svg: the four Get Started illustrations, each an exported
      design frame wrapping a raster image.
    android/app/src/main/res/mipmap-*/ic_launcher*.png
    ios/BrainChipConnect/Images.xcassets/AppIcon.appiconset/Icon-*.png

  Store listing
    fastlane/metadata/android/en-US/: the listing text, the store icon
      resampled from the app icon above, the feature graphic built on the
      BrainChip logo lockup, and screenshots captured from the app itself.
      `docs/store/README.md` records how each was made.
    docs/store/pre-registration-qr.svg, .png: a QR code generated for the
      listing.

  Legal text
    src/app/content/privacyPolicy.ts and termsAndConditions.ts, and the
    pages rendered from them under docs/pages/.

  Test fixtures
    __tests__/fixtures/kws_program_info.bin and kws_edge_learning_info.yaml:
    model metadata in the format of the AkidaTag firmware,
    https://github.com/Brainchip-Inc/AkidaTag.

  Fonts
    None are bundled. The styles name the Inter and Sora families, but no
    font file ships in the repository and no platform font registration
    exists, so the app renders in each platform's default typeface. See
    "The custom font families are not bundled" in AGENTS.md.

